the section an overlay replaces can be deleted outright:
overlay: 1 section(s), 1 conflict(s)
  gone sec-2
            the section this replaces is no longer in the file

-- rebase cannot invent a section to sit on, and refuses to drop it silently
   rebased: 0
   unresolved: sec-2 — the section this replaces is no longer in the file
   the edit is still there for the user to look at: 1

-- discarding is the explicit act (§9.2)
   edits now: 0
